    "detailed_description": "Join our ninja basketball goblin girl from the past, Himari, on a mission to save the city from a robot invasion! Resurrected five years after her death, she teams up with friends, Ikari,  Tatsumi, &amp; Kimiko in a short Metroidvania full of tight platforming, unlockables, and secrets.<br>Race against time in speedrunning or take your time unlocking characters &amp; see the story unfold!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A narrative-driven, single-player goblin girl adventure with a charming cast of monster girl characters and a touching story of friendship<br></li><li>A massive robot fortress teeming with 40+ rooms of hardcore platforming challenges and devious secrets<br></li><li>Many color alts and characters to unlock, built for only the most clever ninja basketbrawlers<br></li><li> Tons of original chiptune music goodness consisting of catchy 8-bit beats.<br></li><li>Lightning-fast respawns to keep on brawling as you uncover the mysteries of the robot fortress!</li></ul>",
